      "archive_header": "#---------------------------\n# Translated Prophetic Hadiths\n# Language: ไทย\n# Source: https://hadeethenc.com/th\n# Last update: 2026-05-10 17:59:02 (v1.34.0)\n# Check for updates: https://hadeethenc.com/en/check/th/v1.34.0\n# PLEASE DON'T REMOVE THIS IMPORTANT INFORMATION!\n#---------------------------"
